// prerequisites name pre-primary readiness skills HOREB defines here (READINESS, written to g1.json as `readiness`,
// CRE.PP2.READINESS.*): KICD's PP1-PP2 Religious Education design is not in this repository, so a CRE teacher should confirm
// them. Habits and performances (praying with family, keeping the home clean, dramatising, song and dance, obeying, Sunday
// school, humility, gratitude, sharing, honesty, punctuality, serving, reciting prayers) are marked by the teacher with the KICD
// rubric. Questions at this grade are read aloud with pictures. FAITH marks belief lines; SAFE marks child-safety lines.
// Merged by scripts/build-cre-grade.mjs 1. Draft until reviewed.
import { B, P, FAITH, RULE } from './common.mjs';

